ies":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","review_id":"8Z6Fn4ku-t7tAkU58JWylA","date":"2013-02-04T15:12:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9376335740089417,"text_excerpt":"THIS is the type of place I've been waiting for. The best breakfast in NOLA. In a city drowning in \"cajun/creole\" influence, Russell's stands out. Located next to the beautiful marina, in an easy to find location. They have their share of Cajun/Creole items on the menu but the menu is unique. This is one of the few places that have Belgium waffles -TRUE Belgium waffles. They have eggs beni several ways. Over crab cakes, fried catfish, or fried green tomatoes and bacon. If you come after 10:30am, the lunch menu is also available. Several salads, burgers, and wraps. I went with the fried green tomatoes and bacon eggs beni. I requested poached medium and it was the most perfectly poached egg..."},{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","review_id":"YKsnd1AMhQXqsCyhd9sQRw","date":"2020-11-17T01:15:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9344627261161804,"text_excerpt":"We used to visit Russell's all the time but unfortunately stopped one day. In a last-minute decision, we decided to come back to Russell's once more for brunch this past Sunday and had a great time. They usually almost always have a wait for breakfast, primarily on the weekends, and we wanted to sit outside because COVID so we had to wait a bit for a party of 6 but nothing extravagant. The inside is packed and hectic, and can be a bit off-putting for those that are worried about COVID precautions. The staff all do wear masks, but that doesn't help that the restaurant is so small inside. We started with cocktails and beignets + biscuits and gravy. The gravy needed a bit more seasoning as i..."},{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","review_id":"8TkHp_yLUMmocN_ACSQ9dg","date":"2016-09-15T15:29:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9267857670783997,"text_excerpt":"Great food! I had the Eggs 9th. I love crab!!! It was a cool twist on a Benedict. Service was fast and polite. Cool local spot that reminds you of a diner only they're on the lake. Parking can be a bit tricky. Full bar which was perfect. I'll be back again for sure."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","photo_id":"DLn-rvQpQbZZqS_OC50plQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/DLn-rvQpQbZZqS_OC50plQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8709149360656738},{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","photo_id":"vmuxQYhWj0az6vF1MmrNrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vmuxQYhWj0az6vF1MmrNrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7903280258178711},{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","photo_id":"o3uUX7LXtqGuv5YK5419dQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/o3uUX7LXtqGuv5YK5419dQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7903280258178711},{"business_id":"8ASzjS3ITg5bQSyObsCx5w","photo_id":"2W2YkZbZeyiBDhpueMe7Vw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2W2YkZbZeyiBDhpu